// ochazuke bindings (JSONC): the text view (OpenTextView, a palette text result): a read-only editor whose keys are the editor's; q closes it, as esc does (bindings/modal.json)
{
  "bindings": [
    {"context": "ochazuke.text-view/normal", "bindings": [
      {"key": "q", "action": "ochazuke.modal.pop"}
    ]},
    {"context": "ochazuke.text-view/visual-line", "bindings": []}
  ]
}
